  - obviously i didnt make it in time hehehehe...
  - so is there any questions?
  - oh yeah
  - so obviously i ran out of time and i just had to use the free assets i had
  - 'i am making my own assets for every single thing '
  - 'i just wanted to leave all the art til the end '
  - well i did have music on here... but
  - it was motive by ariana grande so obviously i could not use that
  - and it was too late to change it because of the deadline hehehe
  - but i unfortunately want to torture myself further and also make all the music
    myself!
  - wish me luck......
  - great question
  - she is a mother to all
  - CHUU
  - stream her songs pleak
  - cya
